    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "2 BEDROOM DETACHED HOUSE \r\nNestled in the peaceful countryside of Fanmore, just a short drive from the vibrant village of Falcarragh, this charming detached bungalow offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained home on the Wild Atlantic Way. Set on a generous site with ample parking, a substantial detached garage and shed, the property enjoys a tranquil rural setting while remaining within easy reach of local amenities, beaches, and the stunning Wild Atlantic Way.\r\n \r\nACCOMMODATION: \r\nKitchen, Livingroom, Lounge, Porch, Hallway, Two Bedrooms, Bathroom & Shed"
      },
